  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecuador and Peru Earthquake Relief Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On March 18, 2023, a 6.8 magnitude earthquake struck southern Ecuador near the town of Balao. At least 16 people have been killed in both southern Ecuador and northern Peru. Hundreds more have been injured and many people remain missing underneath rubble.  Your donation to the Ecuador and Peru Earthquake Relief Fund will go to vetted nonprofits on the front lines of relief and recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
